    "text": "\n44\n\nT H E U L T I M A T E A N A B O L I C C O O K B O O K 2 . 0\n\nQuick & Easy Pancakes  \nDirections\n1.\nIn a bowl, mix egg whites, casein protein, sweetener,\nand baking powder/guar gum with a fork until a uniform\nconsistency is achieved.\n2.\nHeat a griddle over low-medium heat. Spray griddle with\ncooking spray. Add mixture to griddle and let sit for 1-2\nminutes until edges appear cooked through.\n3.\nRemove pancake from the griddle and serve on a plate with\ntoppings of choice.\nP R E P T I M E\nR E A D Y I N\n15 MINUTES\n20 MINUTES\nV E G E T A R I A N\nIngredients\nM A K E S 2 P A N C A K E S\n240g (1 cup) regular or flavored Liquid \nMuscle or Muscle Egg egg whites\n25g (¾ scoop) casein protein\n2 packets (4 tsp) sweetener\n~1g (¼ tsp) guar gum\nCooking Spray\nT O P W I T H :\n60ml (4 tbsp) low-calorie syrup (20 \ncalories)\nG L U T E N - F R E E\nC L I C K H E R E T O P U R C H A S E\nL I Q U I D M U S C L E\nC L I C K T O P U R C H A S E M U S C L E \nE G G\nC A L O R I E S\n2 5 5\nF A T ( G )\n1\nC A R B S ( G )\n1 3\nF I B E R ( G )\n0\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n4 7\nN U T R I T I O N\nP E R S E R V I N G\nN O T E :  I L I K E M A K I N G T H I S I N T O 3 R E A L L Y T H I N \nP A N C A K E S . T H I N L I K E C R E P E S . D O W H A T E V E R Y O U \nW A N T ! !",
