    "text": "\n76\n\nT H E U L T I M A T E A N A B O L I C C O O K B O O K 2 . 0\n\nVegan Meatball Sandwich on \nProtein Bread\nDirections\n1.\nHeat up the meatballs in the microwave according to\nthe directions on the package.\n2.\nToast the bread slices in a toaster oven or toaster.\n3.\nBuild the sandwich with the meatballs, lettuce, tomato\n& onion (or veggies of choice). Top with low-calorie\ncondiments such as mustard, horseradish, or sugar-free\nketchup according to your taste preferences.\nIngredients\nM A K E S 1 S A N D W I C H \n2 slices ICON Meals protein bread  or high-\nprotein bread of choice (140 calories per \nslice)\n4 veggie meatballs (up to 120 calories)\nVegetables of choice (15 calories)\nRecommended to top with lettuce, tomato, \n& onion\nCondiments of choice (examples: mustard, \nhorseradish, sugar-free ketchup)\nN U T R I T I O N\nP E R S E R V I N G\nC A L O R I E S\n4 3 0\nF A T ( G )\n1 5\nC A R B S ( G )\n4 3\nF I B E R ( G )\n8\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n4 5\nR E A D Y I N\n10 MINUTES\nV E G A N\nD I F F I C U L T Y\nEASY\nR E G U L A R A S S B R E A D V E R S I O N\n2 slices regular ass bread of choice\nC A L O R I E S\nC A R B S ( G )\nF A T ( G )\nF I B E R ( G )\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n3 1 0\n4 3\n7\n6\n2 1",
