    "text": "\n77\n\nT H E U L T I M A T E A N A B O L I C C O O K B O O K 2 . 0\n\nVeggie Pigs in a \nBlanket (Hot Dog)\nDirections\n1.\nToast the bread slices in a toaster oven or toaster.\n2.\nLay the bread slices flat and spread mayonnaise. Optionally add\nadditional low-calorie condiments such as mustard or horseradish\naccording to your taste preferences.\n3.\nBuild the sandwich with the remaining ingredients. Slice in half\nand serve.\nIngredients\nM A K E S 1 H O T D O G\n1½ weiners of veggie tofu dogs (70 \ncalories)\n1 slice regular ass bread (80 \ncalories)\n1 tbsp yellow mustard\n1 tbsp ketchup\nN U T R I T I O N\nP E R S E R V I N G\nC A L O R I E S\n1 7 0\nF A T ( G )\n3\nC A R B S ( G )\n2 3\nF I B E R ( G )\n1\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n1 4\nC L I C K T O P U R C H A S E Y V E S \nV E G G I E T O F U D O G S\nR E A D Y I N\n10 MINUTES\nV E G E T A R I A N\nD I F F I C U L T Y\nEASY\nC H E E S Y V E R S I O N\nAdd 1 slice (or 19g shredded) fat-free cheese \n(30 calories)\nC A L O R I E S\nC A R B S ( G )\nF A T ( G )\nF I B E R ( G )\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n2 0 0\n2 4\n2\n1\n1 8\nN O T E : I E A T 3 - 4 O F T H E S E A S A M E A L ! !\nI A L S O L I K E T O A D D A S L I C E O F M E L T E D F A T -\nF R E E C H E E S E O N T O P T O M A K E I T M O R E \nD E L I C I O U S T H A N L A S T T I M E !",
