    "text": "\n78\n\nT H E U L T I M A T E A N A B O L I C C O O K B O O K 2 . 0\n\nChicken/Tuna, Lettuce & \nTomato on Protein Bread\nN U T R I T I O N\nP E R S E R V I N G\nC A L O R I E S\nR E G U L A R A S S B R E A D V E R S I O N\nUse 2 slices of regular ass bread instead of \nprotein bread\n4 4 5\nC A L O R I E S\nC A R B S ( G )\nF A T ( G )\nF I B E R ( G )\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n2 7 5\n3 8\n4\n7\n2 3\nF A T ( G )\n1 2\nC A R B S ( G )\n3 8\nF I B E R ( G )\n5\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n4 3\nIngredients\nM A K E S 1 S A N D W I C H\n2 slices ICON Meals protein bread  \nor high-protein bread of choice (140 \ncalories per slice)\nSliced tomato (up to 20 calories)\nLettuce (up to 10 calories)\n4 thin slices of chicken OR ½ can of \nwater-packed tuna (65 calories)\n14g (1 tbsp) light mayonnaise (up to \n30 calories)\nC L I C K H E R E T O P U R C H A S E \nI C O N M E A L S P R O T E I N B R E A D\nP R E P T I M E\nR E A D Y I N\n3 MINUTES\n5 MINUTES\nD I F F I C U L T Y\nEASY\nDirections\n1.\nPlace the bread in the toaster until cooked to a light golden\nbrown.\n2.\nLay the toast flat on a plate and spread the mayonnaise on the\nbread.\n3.\nPlace the chicken or tuna on top of the bread, and then lettuce\nand tomato.\n4.\nTop with the 2nd layer of bread. Serve and enjoy.\nN O T E : P R O T E I N B R E A D I S N O T N E C E S S A R Y ! Y O U C A N \nJ U S T U S E R E G U L A R A S S B R E A D . Y O U D O N ’ T N E E D \nT H E P R O T E I N B R E A D . . . T H E R E ’ S A L R E A D Y P L E N T Y O F \nP R O T E I N I N T H E C H I C K E N / T U N A !\nU S E H I G H P R O T E I N B R E A D I F Y O U R E Q U I R E A L O T O F \nP R O T E I N I N Y O U R D I E T . I F N O T , F E E L F R E E T O C H O O S E \nR E G U L A R A S S B R E A D .",
