    "text": "\n110\n\nT H E U L T I M A T E A N A B O L I C C O O K B O O K 2 . 0\n\nNuPasta Chicken Stirfry\nDirections\n1.\t Cook NuPasta according to package instructions, and set aside.\n2.\t Heat a pan over medium heat. Spray pan with cooking spray. Add \nveggies and chicken to pan and sauté until it is cooked through. \nAdd spices to taste.\n3.\t Add cooked nupasta and pasta sauce to the pan and sauté all \ntogether for a few minutes.\n4.\t Serve and eat altogether in a bowl.\nN U T R I T I O N\nP E R S E R V I N G\nC A L O R I E S\n“ L A R G E ” V E R S I O N S U B S T I T U T I O N S\n1 package of NuPasta (35 calories) \n195g (¾ cup) pasta sauce (up to 90 calories)\n180g chicken breast (cooked)\n1 full serving of veggies (100 calories)\n3 2 0\nF A T ( G )\n6\nC A R B S ( G )\n3 3\nF I B E R ( G )\n1 5\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n3 3\nP R E P T I M E\nR E A D Y I N\n10 MINUTES\n25 MINUTES\nIngredients\nM A K E S 1 S M A L L S E R V I N G\n1 package of NuPasta (35 calories)\n125g (½ cup) pasta sauce (up to 60 \ncalories)\n90g chicken breast (measured \ncooked)\n½ serving veggies (50 calories)\nSpices/condiments to taste\nCooking spray\nG L U T E N - F R E E\nC L I C K H E R E T O P U R C H A S E \nN U P A S T A !\nC A L O R I E S\nC A R B S ( G )\nF A T ( G )\nF I B E R ( G )\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n5 5 5\n4 8\n9\n2 2\n6 5\nC L I C K H E R E T O P U R C H A S E \nP A S T A S A U C E !",
