    "text": "\n161\n\nT H E U L T I M A T E A N A B O L I C C O O K B O O K 2 . 0\n\nDirections\n1.\t Add all ingredients to a bowl, with cottage cheese at the bottom, \nthen Liquid Muscle egg whites, then fruit.\n2.\t Dessert is ready to eat.\nR E A D Y I N\nD I F F I C U L T Y\n10 MINUTES\nEASY\nIngredients\nM A K E S 1 S M A L L S E R V I N G\n125g (½ cup) 0% fat cottage cheese\n125ml (½ cup) Liquid Muscle or \nMuscle Egg flavored egg whites \n(flavor of choice)\n½ serving fruit (up to 50 calories)\nN U T R I T I O N\nP E R S E R V I N G\nC A L O R I E S\n1 9 5\nF A T ( G )\n0\nC A R B S ( G )\n1 8\nF I B E R ( G )\n3\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n2 5\nDairy Dream Protein Dessert \nwith Cottage Cheese\nV E G E T A R I A N\nM E D I U M S E R V I N G\n175g (¾ cup) 0% fat cottage cheese\n125ml (½ cup) Liquid Muscle or Muscle Egg flavored egg \nwhites (flavor of choice)\n¾ serving fruit (up to 75 calories)\nC A L O R I E S\nC A R B S ( G )\nF A T ( G )\nF I B E R ( G )\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n2 5 0\n2 7\n0\n4\n3 1\nC L I C K H E R E T O P U R C H A S E\nL I Q U I D M U S C L E\nC L I C K T O P U R C H A S E M U S C L E \nE G G\nN O T E S : Y O U C A N A L S O U S E L O W C A L O R I E S Y R U P \nA S A T O P P I N G T O R E P L A C E T H E L I Q U I D M U S C L E \nF L A V O R E D E G G W H I T E S\nI O F T E N D O T H I S M Y S E L F W H E N I D O N ’ T H A V E T H E \nL I Q U I D M U S C L E F L A V O R E D E G G W H I T E S A V A I L A B L E !\nY O U C A N U S E R E G U L A R E G G W H I T E S A N D A D D L O W -\nC A L O R I E S Y R U P O R S W E E T E N E R T O T A S T E .\nT H E R E A R E N O R U L E S !",
