    "text": "\n173\n\nT H E U L T I M A T E A N A B O L I C C O O K B O O K 2 . 0\n\nDirections\n1.\nTake the Fiber One Brownie bar and slice it into bite-sized chunks.\nTransfer the brownie chunks into a bowl and set aside.\n2.\nPour water, salt, guar gum, Stevia, fudge protein powder, cocoa\npowder, and ice into the blender. Blend for 1 minute on high.\nAfter 1 minute, make sure to scrape the sides and bottom so that\nall unblended ingredients are thoroughly incorporated. Blend\nagain for 1 minute and 30 seconds on High. Consistency after\nblending should be a thick cream.\n3.\nPlace fudge ice cream mixture into a container. Take the brownie\nchunks and sprinkle on top for added flavor and crunch. Enjoy!\nP R E P T I M E\nR E A D Y I N\n10 MINUTES\n15 MINUTES\nIngredients\nM A K E S 1 L A R G E O R 2 \nS M A L L S E R V I N G S\n66g (2 scoops) fudge protein \npowder (260 calories, 50g protein)\n20g (4 tbsp) cocoa powder\n50g Fiber One Brownie Bar\n4g (~1¼ tsp) guar gum\n2 packets sweetener (4 tsp) OR ~1 \ntbsp Stevia/Erythritol\n¼ tsp salt\n60g water\n420g ice\nChocolate Fudge Brownie \nProtein Ice Cream\nC L I C K T O P U R C H A S E F I B E R \nO N E B R O W N I E B A R\nV E G E T A R I A N\nC L I C K T O P U R C H A S E A N I N J A \nB L E N D E R\nC H E C K O U T\n@ T H E I R O N M U S K E T O N \nY O U T U B E !\nORIGINAL RECIPE BY JOSHUA KRATT AKA “THE IRON MUSKET” ON YOUTUBE\nN U T R I T I O N P E R \nL A R G E S E R V I N G\nC A L O R I E S\n4 6 0\nF A T ( G )\n1 3\nC A R B S ( G )\n6 6\nF I B E R ( G )\n3 3\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n5 6\nP R O T E I N ( G )\n2 9\nN U T R I T I O N P E R \nS M A L L S E R V I N G\nC A L O R I E S\n2 3 0\nF A T ( G )\n6\nC A R B S ( G )\n3 3\nF I B E R ( G )\n1 6",
